<div class="guide-styles" data-zaf-dynamic="article" id="guide-body" lang="en">Welcome to Wowhead's Phase 2 Best in Slot Gear list for Fire Mage DPS in Wrath of the Lich King Classic. Gear in this guide is primarily obtained from Naxxramas, Obsidian Sanctum, Eye of Eternity, and Ulduar. This guide will list the recommended gear for your class and role, containing gear sourced from raids, dungeons, PvP, professions, BoE World drops, and reputations.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot">Best in Slot Gear for Fire Mage DPS Phase 2</h2>Fire Mage in Phase 2 much like other classes gets a <b>full gear overhaul</b> due to the new ilvl boost in Ulduar. The potential of Fire goes up quite a lot this phase due to partially the new gear but also the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item-set=-85/conquerors-kirin-tor-garb">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Conqueror's Kirin Tor Garb</span></a> set bonus which will occasionally provide an extra <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=42891/pyroblast">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_fireball02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pyroblast</span></a>. This also means that early gearing isn't that difficult considering it uses four pieces of tier gear, two of which you can buy with <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=221/emblem-of-conquest">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_championsgrace.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Conquest</span></span></a>.<br/>
<br/>Additionally there's also a second set for <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=47610/frostfire-bolt">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_mage_frostfirebolt.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Frostfire Bolt</span></a> Mages, <b>I personally don't recommend this</b> because even though it needs less Hit to reach cap - it requires more high ilvl gear to perform similarly and doesn't provide <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=54648/focus-magic">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_arcane_studentofmagic.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Focus Magic</span></a> to another player. Making it both harder to gear with more contested gear, and a lower raid dps specialization.<br/>
<br/>
<i>
<span class="c6">FFB Warning:</span> Although Frostfire Best in Slot doesn't include 4 piece <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item-set=-85/conquerors-kirin-tor-garb">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Conqueror's Kirin Tor Garb</span></a> in absolute BiS, this doesn't mean you shouldn't wear it. In a lot of fights, especially in Ulduar, being able to damage the enemies while moving has great value. Even though 2 piece <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item-set=-85/conquerors-kirin-tor-garb">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Conqueror's Kirin Tor Garb</span></a> combined with 3x 252 off-pieces might sim higher, doesn't mean it will perform higher in all fights as there's other factors involved. </i>
<br/>
