<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="emblems">Emblems of Conquest for Fire Mage DPS Phase 2</h3>Fire mage depends a lot on <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item-set=-85/conquerors-kirin-tor-garb">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Conqueror's Kirin Tor Garb</span></a>, so you'll be buying that as soon as possible with your <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=221/emblem-of-conquest">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_championsgrace.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Conquest</span></span></a>. Tier is also consistently drops from raid, and with 10-man tier outperforming both the new legs and gloves there's not much value in buying these. As for the Belt, you're better off buying <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45087/runed-orb">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_runedorb_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Runed Orb</span></a>s to craft <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45557/sash-of-ancient-power">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_10.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sash of Ancient Power</span></a> instead. And the neck is just worse than <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=3456/naxxramas">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Naxxramas</span></a> necks from <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=15989/sapphiron">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Sapphiron</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
