<span class="tinyicontxt">Conqueror's Kirin Tor Garb</span></a> set bonus. There's also <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45520/handwraps-of-the-vigilant">
