<span class="tinyicontxt">Conqueror's Kirin Tor Garb</span></a> set bonuses, this is the best item here assuming you're Fire. If you're either playing Frostfire or if you already have the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item-set=-85/conquerors-kirin-tor-garb">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Conqueror's Kirin Tor Garb</span></a> 4-piece equipped through the other slots, then <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45488/leggings-of-the-enslaved-idol">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_cloth_27.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leggings of the Enslaved Idol</span></a> will be the best option. Additionally, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45488/leggings-of-the-enslaved-idol">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_cloth_27.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leggings of the Enslaved Idol</span></a> is also best in slot if you choose to use non-hit weapon such as <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45457/staff-of-endless-winter">
