<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="neck">Neck for Fire Mage DPS Phase 2</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45133/pendant-of-fiery-havoc">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_31.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pendant of Fiery Havoc</span></a> is the best neck for Fire Mages. If you're already Hit capped, then <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45933/pendant-of-the-shallow-grave">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_46.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pendant of the Shallow Grave</span></a> is the best alternative. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=44661/wyrmrest-necklace-of-power">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_amulet_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Wyrmrest Necklace of Power</span></a> from the previous tier is still better than most new necks assuming you can use its Hit properly. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45243/sapphire-amulet-of-renewal">
