<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="rings">Rings for Fire Mage DPS Phase 2</h3>Assuming you're already Hit capped, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45495/conductive-seal">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_66.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conductive Seal</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46046/nebula-band">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_70.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nebula Band</span></a> are the best rings. If you do need some Hit, then <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45451/frozen-loop">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_57.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Frozen Loop</span></a> is the best option, followed by <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45297/shimmering-seal">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_63.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shimmering Seal</span></a>. If you don't need Hit but also haven't gotten the BiS rings, then <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45168/pyrelight-circle">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_71.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pyrelight Circle</span></a> is a great option, followed by <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45691/inscribed-signet-of-the-kirin-tor">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_73.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Inscribed Signet of the Kirin Tor</span></a> which can buy in <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4395/dalaran">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Dalaran</span></a>. Lastly there's still <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40399/signet-of-manifested-pain">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_51naxxramas.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Signet of Manifested Pain</span></a> from previous tier content which is now easier to get from 10-Man <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=3456/naxxramas">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Naxxramas</span></a>. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46096/signet-of-soft-lament">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_29.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Signet of Soft Lament</span></a> is a great early option that's easy to acquire, it performs similarly to <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45168/pyrelight-circle">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_71.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pyrelight Circle</span></a>.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
<div class="quote-header"></div>
<div class="quote-body" data-markup-content-target="1">
<b>BiS Ring Enchant</b>: If you are an <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif");'>Enchanter</span>- use <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=44636/enchant-ring-greater-spellpower">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Ring - Greater Spellpower</span></a>. This profession isn't recommended.</div></div>
