<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="trinkets">Trinkets for Fire Mage DPS Phase 2</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45518/flare-of-the-heavens">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonlightwell.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Flare of the Heavens</span></a> far outperforms anything else in the game and will likely still be best in slot in phase 3. As for your second trinket slot, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45466/scale-of-fates">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_spiritshard_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Scale of Fates</span></a> is the best option assuming you're Hit capped. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45308/eye-of-the-broodmother">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_eye_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Eye of the Broodmother</span></a> is an easy upgrade to get from 10-man that performs as well as previous phases' best in slot.<br/>
<br/>If you do need some Hit, then <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40255/dying-curse">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_trinket_naxxramas03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dying Curse</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45148/living-flame">
